---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/site/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/site/Footer.astro';

const title = 'Terms of Service — Rearrange PDF';
const description =
  'The terms that apply when you use rearrangepdf.com to rearrange PDF pages in your browser.';
---

<Layout title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/terms">
  <Nav />
  <main id="main">
    <article class="bg-canvas-soft">
      <div class="container-page py-12 md:py-16 max-w-3xl">
        <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="text-body-sm text-mute">
          <a href="/" class="hover:text-ink transition-colors">Home</a>
          <span aria-hidden="true"> / </span>
          <span aria-current="page" class="text-body">Terms of service</span>
        </nav>

        <h1 class="mt-4 font-black text-display-sm md:text-display-md">Terms of service</h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-body-sm text-mute">Last updated: September 2026</p>

        <h2 class="mt-10 text-display-xs font-semibold">1. The service</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body-md text-body">
          Rearrange PDF (rearrangepdf.com) is a free, browser-based tool that lets you rearrange,
          rotate, duplicate, delete and organize the pages of PDF files. All processing takes
          place locally in your web browser; your files are not uploaded to us.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-8 text-display-xs font-semibold">2. Acceptance</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body-md text-body">
          By using the site you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the
          service.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-8 text-display-xs font-semibold">3. Your content</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body-md text-body">
          You keep all rights to the documents you work on. Since files are processed on your own
          device, we never receive, store or process them. You are responsible for having the
          rights to any document you open in the tool and for complying with applicable law.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-8 text-display-xs font-semibold">4. No warranty</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body-md text-body">
          The service is provided "as is", free of charge, without warranties of any kind. We
          work hard to keep it accurate and reliable — page content is copied byte-for-byte from
          your original file — but we cannot guarantee uninterrupted availability or fitness for
          a particular purpose. Keep backups of important documents.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-8 text-display-xs font-semibold">5. Limitation of liability</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body-md text-body">
          To the maximum extent permitted by law, we are not liable for any damages arising from
          the use or inability to use the service.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-8 text-display-xs font-semibold">6. Changes</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body-md text-body">
          We may update the service or these terms at any time. Continued use after changes means
          you accept the updated terms. The current version is always available on this page.
        </p>

        <h2 class="mt-8 text-display-xs font-semibold">7. Contact</h2>
        <p class="mt-2 text-body-md text-body">
          Questions about these terms? Email
          <a href="mailto:hello@rearrangepdf.com" class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-2">hello@rearrangepdf.com</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
